<section class="container recommendation" aria-labelledby="recommendation-title"><div class="recommendation-card"><p class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR DIRECTION</p><h2 id="recommendation-title">三個問題，找到合作方向。</h2><p>依你的想法給出起點，最後仍會一起確認拍攝內容。</p><form id="plan-questions"><label for="plan-goal">這次想完成什麼？<select id="plan-goal" required><option value="">請選擇</option><option value="portrait">先體驗合作，完成一組人像</option><option value="story">有故事、角色或場景的作品</option></select></label><label for="plan-preparation">目前準備到哪裡？<select id="plan-preparation" required><option value="">請選擇</option><option value="exploring">還在找方向，想一起討論</option><option value="ready">已有主題、服裝或參考</option></select></label><label for="plan-time">時間安排呢？<select id="plan-time" required><option value="">請選擇</option><option value="short">時間比較有限</option><option value="flexible">可以依企劃安排</option></select></label><button class="button button--primary" type="submit">看看建議</button></form><div id="plan-result" class="recommendation-result" hidden aria-live="polite"><h3 id="plan-result-title"></h3><p id="plan-result-reason"></p><p id="plan-result-time"></p><a class="button button--secondary" id="plan-result-link">帶著建議填寫意向</a></div><noscript><p>你也可以直接查看上方的合作方式，填寫意向後一起討論。</p></noscript></div></section>
<script>
 import {recommendPlan} from '../lib/plan-recommendation.js';
 document.getElementById('plan-questions')?.addEventListener('submit',event=>{event.preventDefault();const value=(id:string)=>(document.getElementById(id) as HTMLSelectElement).value;const result=recommendPlan({goal:value('plan-goal'),preparation:value('plan-preparation'),time:value('plan-time')});if(!result)return;document.getElementById('plan-result')!.hidden=false;document.getElementById('plan-result-title')!.textContent=`建議從「${result.title}」開始`;document.getElementById('plan-result-reason')!.textContent=result.reason;document.getElementById('plan-result-time')!.textContent=result.timeNote;(document.getElementById('plan-result-link') as HTMLAnchorElement).href=`/?recommendation=${result.key}#contact`;});
</script>
<style>
 .recommendation {padding-block:40px;}.recommendation-card{padding:clamp(24px,4vw,48px);background:#fff;border-radius:32px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);}.recommendation h2{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);}.recommendation p{line-height:1.85;margin-block:16px;}.recommendation form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px;align-items:end;margin-top:28px;}.recommendation label{display:grid;gap:10px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.8;}.recommendation select{width:100%;min-height:48px;border:1px solid #c4d7e0;border-radius:14px;padding:12px;font:inherit;background:#fff;}.recommendation form .button{grid-column:1/-1;justify-self:start;}.recommendation-result{margin-top:28px;padding:24px;background:#edf7fc;border-radius:20px;}.recommendation-result[hidden]{display:none;}.recommendation select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--color-primary);outline-offset:3px;}@media(max-width:760px){.recommendation form{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.recommendation .button{width:100%;}}
</style>
